OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA wet and
OL,6,Fwindy start to the night. Clear spells
OL,7,Ffollow the rain, with a few showers
OL,8,Fpossible, but most places will stay
OL,9,Fdry. Remaining windy.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FStrong winds continue, with
OL,12,Fsunshine and showers. Heavier showers
OL,13,Fare likely across northern parts, and
OL,14,Fgale-force winds, or stronger, across
OL,15,Fhigh ground and along the coast. Drier
OL,16,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
